  "body": "## What changed\nThe Setup -> Post page could show the scroll bar over the post option checkboxes. A click then went to the bar.\n\n- New helper `layout::keep_scroll_gutter` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/layout/scroll_gutter.rs`). It keeps a gap on the right as wide as the style's scroll bar width plus its margins.\n- `properties_body` (`pages.rs`) now calls the helper. This fixes the Setup -> Post page.\n- The Post dialog and the operation page use the same helper. Their behaviour does not change (floor 0 and floor 120, as before).\n\n## Readings\n- Window 500 x 420, built-in Fanuc post, Setup -> Post page, \"Write tool list\" checkbox.\n- On main: the checkbox is at x 474..492 and a real click does not toggle the option (`left: None`).\n- On this head: the checkbox is at x 460..478 and a real click toggles the option.\n\n## Pinning test\n`egui_app::setup_post_gap_tests::setup_post_page_option_checkbox_is_clickable_when_the_page_scrolls`. It was red on main (without the fix) and is green on this head. The click is a real pointer click through the harness. The option is written through the existing undoable command.\n\n## Tests that ran\n- `cargo xtask gate test setup_post_page_option_checkbox_is_clickable_when_the_page_scrolls --crate camcraft-ui --exact`: ok.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -j 6`: 1428 passed, 0 failed, 7 ignored (this includes the `page_layout` and `structural` tests).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -j 6 -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n- Quick gate wrapper, heavy lanes and pixel snapshots. No snapshot PNG changed. The change reaches `camcraft-ui` only.\n- No application window was started.\n- Other pages that use `properties_body` (Stock, WCS, Model, Setups) now have a narrower content width by the gap. No test asserts a size there, and no named layout test changed.\n- The `match` in `properties_body` has one more nesting level. Its lines are not re-indented, to keep the diff small.\n\n## Screenshots\nThe pictures are headless renders of the test harness (egui_kittest) in a 500 x 420 window, Setup -> Post page, built-in Fanuc post. No application window was started. The images are on the images-only `screenshots` branch (commit `177383ad6`). No image is on this PR branch.\n\nBefore: main `a47c7ff22`. The checkboxes stand at the right edge, next to the scroll bar (checkbox x 474..492 of 500).\n\n![Before: checkboxes at the scroll bar](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/177383ad655bebd9f01458915eca81e226895093/pr-3392/setup-post-before.png)\n\nAfter: this PR head `b53939e89`. The content keeps a gap on the right (checkbox x 460..478 of 500).\n\n![After: checkboxes clear of the scroll bar](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/177383ad655bebd9f01458915eca81e226895093/pr-3392/setup-post-after.png)\n\nChangelog: Setup -> Post page: a post option checkbox at the right edge is clickable again when the scroll bar shows.\n\nEffort: low (not escalated)\n\nFixes #3390\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
